---
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import { GIT_REPO_URL } from "../lib/resources";
---

<DocsLayout noSidebar>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <span class="opacity-80">Last updated: October 20th, 2025</span>
    <hr />
    <p>
      This website is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Consult their <a
        href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Privacy Policy</a
      > to see how they collect and process your information.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <h2>
      Darkwrite does not collect, store, transfer or otherwise process your
      data.
    </h2>
    <p>
      This website has no trackers, no cookies, no nothing. Similarly, the
      Darkwrite app <strong>does not collect anything about you.</strong> All your
      data is stored on-device. We are not interested in tracking you online. We
      just want to deliver you the best experience.
    </p>
    <p>
      The desktop app may make requests to the GitHub API in order to notify you
      of updates. If you don&apos;t want this for whatever reason, you can
      disable it in the application settings.
    </p>
    <hr />
    <p>
      If you have any questions, you can contact us at <a
        href="mailto:burak.yn.dev@gmail.com">burak.yn.dev@gmail.com</a
      >, or on <a href={GIT_REPO_URL + "/issues"}>GitHub issues.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
